<BaseLayout title="Website Terms | Hoffman Family Orthodontics" description="Information about using the Hoffman Family Orthodontics website and its Google Maps features.">
<main id="main" class="interior-page"><div class="container policy-layout"><div class="policy-heading"><p class="section-kicker">Website information</p><h1>Website terms.</h1></div><article class="policy-copy"><h2>Information about your care</h2><p>This website provides general information about our practice and orthodontic treatment. It does not replace an examination or a personalized treatment recommendation. Contact our office to discuss your own care.</p><h2>Google Maps features</h2><p>Google Maps features and content are subject to the <a href="https://maps.google.com/help/terms_maps/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Maps/Google Earth Additional Terms of Service</a> and the <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Privacy Policy</a>.</p><p>When live reviews are available, the website displays five-star written reviews from the selection supplied by Google, ordered newest first within that selection. This is not the complete review history. Reviewers describe their own experiences; treatment needs and results vary.</p><h2>Contact and privacy</h2><p>Call <a href="tel:+19016250202">901.625.0202</a> with questions about this website. Read our <a href="/privacy-policy/">privacy policy</a> for information about personal data and third-party features.</p></article></div></main>
</BaseLayout>
